Package: approx
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Non-interactive POSIX fuzzy stream filter and ranker
 approx is a lightweight, zero-dependency POSIX CLI utility that scores,
 filters, and ranks streaming text using normalized approximate string distance.
 Built for automated UNIX pipelines, shell scripts, and embedded systems.
